        "text": "Page: Kickin' It. Sentence: Kickin' It is an American martial arts-inspired comedy television series that originally aired on Disney XD from June 13, 2011 to March 25, 2015.\nPage: Kickin' It. Sentence: Created and executive produced by Jim O'Doherty, the series follows the karate instructor at an under-performing martial arts academy, played by Jason Earles, and his five misfit students, played by Leo Howard, Dylan Riley Snyder, , Olivia Holt, and .\nPage: Leo Howard. Sentence: Howard was certified as the youngest TV director ever by the Guinness World Records for his work on the episode \"Fight at the Museum\" in the fourth season of the \"Kickin' It\" TV series at age 16.",
